  "title": "Set Limits for Growth Items 【RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin】",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "成長アイテムに限界値を設定する【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "d97d6f09bcf4d4776c10914bc710ca9dd09d8b199a18ade54b86095712c002d5",
      "translation": "Set Limits for Growth Items 【RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin】",
      "contextHash": "d97d6f09bcf4d4776c10914bc710ca9dd09d8b199a18ade54b86095712c002d5"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "成長アイテムの成長量に限界値を設定します。",
      "sourceHash": "f918b4a64afef2a2d7e45942fc55a56f7a761b7529f6e210efb8cb7468934f37",
      "translation": "Sets a limit on the amount by which growth items increase parameters.",
      "contextHash": "f918b4a64afef2a2d7e45942fc55a56f7a761b7529f6e210efb8cb7468934f37"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "無制限にアクターを強化されないようにします。",
      "sourceHash": "5264d8bc0a08a2df9ccd53855caa597700bf808b2831cb128c67838c4644d3b8",
      "translation": "Prevents actors from being strengthened without limit.",
      "contextHash": "5264d8bc0a08a2df9ccd53855caa597700bf808b2831cb128c67838c4644d3b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、パラメータ自体に限界値を設けるのではなく、パラメータの成長値に限界を設ける方式です。",
      "sourceHash": "5c020e257616a152fa4ed27f5118c2ed80079478d2626bcb81ebfd000e12c6f3",
      "translation": "Note that this method sets a limit on the parameter's growth value, rather than on the parameter itself.",
      "contextHash": "5c020e257616a152fa4ed27f5118c2ed80079478d2626bcb81ebfd000e12c6f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "上の動画では、最大ＨＰが＋１００までしか上がらないようにしています。それ以上はブザーが鳴って、アイテムも消費されません。",
      "sourceHash": "866d980d1c895c89a14184420fbf8978396f8f5d8e0192af84031338272f8992",
      "translation": "In the video above, Max HP is set so that it can only increase by up to +100. Beyond that, a buzzer sounds and the item is not consumed.",
      "contextHash": "866d980d1c895c89a14184420fbf8978396f8f5d8e0192af84031338272f8992"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のファイルを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "7f5880d732c954e0e725bc277f22b64c316416f8cec8a7b7a0622deed1c8217a",
      "translation": "Right-click to save the following file, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature on in RPG Maker's Plugin Manager.",
      "contextHash": "7f5880d732c954e0e725bc277f22b64c316416f8cec8a7b7a0622deed1c8217a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
    {
