      "contextHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-004",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2024/07/15（ver1.01）",
      "sourceHash": "feb52f147932aa9dc10f2de179312a9e883dec2645c62220196bb7f59aa8e453",
      "translation": "2024/07/15 (ver1.01) ",
      "contextHash": "feb52f147932aa9dc10f2de179312a9e883dec2645c62220196bb7f59aa8e453"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "制限値が空白の際に成長アイテムが使用できなくなってしまう不具合修正。",
      "sourceHash": "a11c7283a6354300180742bb59f450352307a48e00961bafebbfb0a8666945de",
      "translation": "Fixed a bug that prevented growth items from being used when the limit value was blank.",
      "contextHash": "a11c7283a6354300180742bb59f450352307a48e00961bafebbfb0a8666945de"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2023/02/26（ver1.00）",
      "sourceHash": "97d5b96cbfc4b8952f3e9f2258d37a53b78318caa0665bd286b0eafe24008549",
      "translation": "2023/02/26 (ver1.00) ",
      "contextHash": "97d5b96cbfc4b8952f3e9f2258d37a53b78318caa0665bd286b0eafe24008549"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-002",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Released!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "使用方法（Usage）",
      "sourceHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9",
      "translation": "Usage (Usage)",
      "contextHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "パラメータ制限リストに各パラメータの制限値を設定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "dab46d07cca86746eb2999396689945ba90fbc39a56f8a686787e25cec2de6d1",
      "translation": "Set the limit value for each parameter in the parameter limit list.",
      "contextHash": "dab46d07cca86746eb2999396689945ba90fbc39a56f8a686787e25cec2de6d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "他プラグインとの連携（Integration）",
      "sourceHash": "27671976236d46827ac1e7f5194ff2b9f4862dbf363d4aab455495c74803c04d",
      "translation": "Integration with Other Plugins (Integration)",
      "contextHash": "27671976236d46827ac1e7f5194ff2b9f4862dbf363d4aab455495c74803c04d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "あちらで使用した『ＴＰのパラメータＩＤ』の値をプラグインパラメータで指定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "54f1ac815ac747769d077cd05f81375c4c9872ca9c7188b037edae67b05d112a",
      "translation": "Specify the value of the “TP Parameter ID” used there in the plugin parameter.",
      "contextHash": "54f1ac815ac747769d077cd05f81375c4c9872ca9c7188b037edae67b05d112a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "その他の独自パラメータを作成するプラグインとも、同様の方法で併用できるかも知れませんが、実装次第なので保証できません。",
      "sourceHash": "f2fcce66293023ed43765e4bf41fbd0bc08e7f9981853b2e358196845e0c8080",
      "translation": "It may also be possible to use this alongside plugins that create other custom parameters in the same way, but this depends on their implementation and cannot be guaranteed.",
      "contextHash": "f2fcce66293023ed43765e4bf41fbd0bc08e7f9981853b2e358196845e0c8080"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameter）",
      "sourceHash": "f4b540e9f0397a1265e0ce8b0574e8fade43b17d30f049312ef0f2eb5efd4805",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameter)",
      "contextHash": "f4b540e9f0397a1265e0ce8b0574e8fade43b17d30f049312ef0f2eb5efd4805"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "パラメータ制限リスト（LimitParamList）",
      "sourceHash": "58ecb35568e5a9607947007cae7f24e41a0e9be1d377b64e91f3c9912b051b14",
      "translation": "Parameter Limit List (LimitParamList)",
      "contextHash": "58ecb35568e5a9607947007cae7f24e41a0e9be1d377b64e91f3c9912b051b14"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "対象とするパラメータとその制限値です。",
      "sourceHash": "f39e38d248b2bc19b96e538f504a9fa98d58cf0b9d61ca35aacaa37cbd0a59b6",
      "translation": "The parameters to target and their limit values.",
      "contextHash": "f39e38d248b2bc19b96e538f504a9fa98d58cf0b9d61ca35aacaa37cbd0a59b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "内容については以下の『プラグインパラメータ（リスト内）』を参照してください。",
      "sourceHash": "ba5f257342307f4cb8c06dbce9abc26a16bf7956cea299d9b9c99013bbc0d5a9",
      "translation": "For details, refer to the following “Plugin Parameters (Within the List)” section.",
      "contextHash": "ba5f257342307f4cb8c06dbce9abc26a16bf7956cea299d9b9c99013bbc0d5a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（リスト内）（Plugin Parameter List）",
      "sourceHash": "411788dbd6fe1c66f1be908840653572a4acf162d33f8d4716ba4125dfac5032",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Within the List) (Plugin Parameter List)",
      "contextHash": "411788dbd6fe1c66f1be908840653572a4acf162d33f8d4716ba4125dfac5032"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "パラメータＩＤ（ParamId）",
      "sourceHash": "9136ac181138ad972be8d966e7f4a92c216e959c7f87f9d0905447fb3d7efeff",
      "translation": "Parameter ID (ParamId)",
      "contextHash": "9136ac181138ad972be8d966e7f4a92c216e959c7f87f9d0905447fb3d7efeff"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "対象とするパラメータＩＤです。",
      "sourceHash": "15689a3250f3fa085fbe91cbc118d9ea2411fb06497d735e49ef3f39587997be",
      "translation": "The parameter ID to target.",
      "contextHash": "15689a3250f3fa085fbe91cbc118d9ea2411fb06497d735e49ef3f39587997be"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "注釈（Note）",
      "sourceHash": "b72a13bdc7652290eb8671a16bbdbc0586a60b239150c3d50cec77d0d4be2d10",
      "translation": "Note (Note)",
      "contextHash": "b72a13bdc7652290eb8671a16bbdbc0586a60b239150c3d50cec77d0d4be2d10"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "パラメータの説明です。",
      "sourceHash": "0d8c0097da4627888c5d6ad34155408e7f08ceb8b3e8c224114daf23b895bfad",
      "translation": "A description of the parameter.",
      "contextHash": "0d8c0097da4627888c5d6ad34155408e7f08ceb8b3e8c224114daf23b895bfad"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ゲーム内では使用しない管理用の項目です。",
      "sourceHash": "bb6bca51ecd060f0e5cb3c4c6e30b47eda42546d58008f200ff1c6ca877bad9f",
      "translation": "This is an administrative field not used in-game.",
      "contextHash": "bb6bca51ecd060f0e5cb3c4c6e30b47eda42546d58008f200ff1c6ca877bad9f"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "制限値（LimitNumber）",
      "sourceHash": "d7aa60487dbfbbef7d0c3d231dc297ec63cbb0d0cc78f91fa95e358e2c3530d1",
      "translation": "Limit Value (LimitNumber)",
      "contextHash": "d7aa60487dbfbbef7d0c3d231dc297ec63cbb0d0cc78f91fa95e358e2c3530d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "上昇量の制限値です。",
      "sourceHash": "b5597c1fd04aa0318660a567a643beae117a9276f92c29836ba199a6c40eda10",
      "translation": "The limit on the amount of increase.",
      "contextHash": "b5597c1fd04aa0318660a567a643beae117a9276f92c29836ba199a6c40eda10"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "この値を超えた上昇はできなくなります。",
      "sourceHash": "d9f231addbf30d80efb58fca609607ac7c732739185b3aa47e5be2a0b554d125",
      "translation": "Increases exceeding this value will not be possible.",
      "contextHash": "d9f231addbf30d80efb58fca609607ac7c732739185b3aa47e5be2a0b554d125"
    }
  ],
